{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumi &amp; The Lost Tablets is a colorful 3D platformer for all ages. Jump, glide and puzzle your way across the ocean floor to find the lost stone tablets to take on corrupted foes and restore peace to the sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump. glide and explore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and glide your way across two colorful areas - the Reef and the Ruins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the levels to find pearls and stone tablets. Use the tablets to unlock special boss doors to face various sea creatures at the end of each area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the ocean!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fearsome bosses to save the once peaceful creatures from corruption. As you collect the tablets for each boss door, you'll learn real world facts about the animals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929190?t=1767719690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929190?t=1767719690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929190/72d9064fe4dc3ba5a5b4a109e8fd3373dd4e4352/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767719690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929190/72d9064fe4dc3ba5a5b4a109e8fd3373dd4e4352/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767719690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumi &amp; The Lost Tablets is a colorful 3D platformer for all ages. Jump, glide and puzzle your way across the ocean floor to find the lost stone tablets to take on corrupted foes and restore peace to the sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump. glide and explore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and glide your way across two colorful areas - the Reef and the Ruins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the levels to find pearls and stone tablets. Use the tablets to unlock special boss doors to face various sea creatures at the end of each area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the ocean!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fearsome bosses to save the once peaceful creatures from corruption. As you collect the tablets for each boss door, you'll learn real world facts about the animals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Arc Ace"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929190/b98d156ca21c1682bc066a5024295c7195257258/header.jpg?t=1767719690","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929190/1095050871/42d7cb34b6ce3554b46009fd46bfd92cb18d5011/1757571451/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758588320","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929190/1095050871/42d7cb34b6ce3554b46009fd46bfd92cb18d5011/1757571451/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758588320","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929190/1095050871/42d7cb34b6ce3554b46009fd46bfd92cb18d5011/1757571451/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758588320","id":257196012,"name":"LUMI and The Lost Tablets